# The deployable site is web/. Running `vercel` from the repository root sweeps up the
# research tree with it -- artifacts/ is 18 GB of checkpoints, runs*/ another 3.6 GB, and
# data/raw is a symlink onto an 11 GB dataset volume. That is the 21 GB upload.
#
# Deploy from web/, or better, let the Git integration build from GitHub, which holds 8 MB.

*
!web/
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/.vercel
